[00:01.52]1. Praise Jehovah, God of peace,
[00:07.58]God of unity.
[00:13.66]He will make all wars to cease,
[00:19.74]Bring in harmony.
[00:26.18]Prince of Peace is Christ his Son,
[00:31.62]Tender, calm, and kind.
[00:38.04]When the fight for right he’s won,
[00:43.72]Perfect peace we’ll find.
[00:50.50]2. We have left off angry words,
[01:01.76]Making quarrels cease.
[01:06.66]We have made from spears and swords,
[01:12.60]Implements of peace.
[01:18.68]If this peace we want to keep,
[01:24.48]Then we must forgive.
[01:30.30]Peacefully as Jesus’ sheep,
[01:36.04]May we learn and live.
[01:44.80]3. Peace from God gives proof to all;
[01:50.62]He has blessed our way.
[01:56.38]His commands we gladly keep,
[02:01.46]Ready to obey.
[02:07.52]We would recommend our way,
[02:14.08]Show our peaceful care
[02:19.42]Till the Kingdom’s perfect day
[02:30.22]Brings peace ev’rywhere.
